      "id": "showcase_source",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Real data: source and scope",
      "description": "T-LESS, CC BY 4.0. Tomas Hodan, Pavel Haluza, Stepan Obdrzalek, Jiri Matas, Manolis Lourakis, Xenophon Zabulis; WACV 2017. cmp.felk.cvut.cz/t-less/. Real Primesense scene 1, frame 220; original depth and intrinsics retained. Publisher depth_scale=0.1 mm/sample (0.0001 m/sample). No object mask is used. This ROS codec example reconstructs organized pixels with NaN holes. It performs no ROS or robot operation, and does not establish TF calibration. Source/hash/license: ../../Simple Plugins/3d_locate/real_tless/source/ATTRIBUTION.md. Recorded single-frame CameraInfo/RGB-D association. Dataset frame identity supplies the fixed ticket; headers are zero because no ROS exposure timestamp is supplied. Allow zero stamps is explicit and does not prove acquisition clock synchronization. Original metric depth is passed as 32FC1 meters; no synthetic acquisition time is invented.",
